Title: How DebugSwift Intercepts App Traffic (Layman Mode)
participant "App User"
participant "Mobile App"
participant "DebugSwift Inspector"
participant "Mock Test Engine"
participant "Real Internet Server"

"App User"->"Mobile App": Tap "View Profile" Button
"Mobile App"->"DebugSwift Inspector": Prepare to send request to the Internet
"DebugSwift Inspector"->"Mock Test Engine": Does developer have a test rule for this?
"Mock Test Engine"-->"DebugSwift Inspector": Yes! Use local test profile data
Note over "DebugSwift Inspector": Block real internet request\n(No data sent over WiFi/Cellular)
"DebugSwift Inspector"-->"Mobile App": Return instant test profile (VIP Status)
"Mobile App"-->"App User": Display VIP Screen on device immediately
